sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrator
    actor Guest as Public / Citizen
    participant AdmCtrl as AdminGamificationController
    participant PubCtrl as GamificationController
    participant CfgSvc as GamificationConfigService
    participant LbSvc as LeaderboardService
    participant PtsSvc as PointsService
    participant AuditSvc as AuditLogService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Admin,DB: A-07 & A-08: Cau hinh he so diem, bang cap cay, chu ky BXH & chot thuong Top 3 (BR-GAM-07, BR-ADM-05)

    Admin->>AdmCtrl: PUT /api/v1/admin/gamification/config (PointRates, TreeLevels, DailyCap)
    AdmCtrl->>CfgSvc: UpdateAsync(adminId, dto)
    CfgSvc->>DB: Validate cap cay lien tuc tu 1 tang dan nghiem ngat & Khong bo cap con EcoFact ACTIVE
    CfgSvc->>DB: BeginTransaction -> Update gamification_config + Replace point_rate_rules & tree_level_thresholds
    CfgSvc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("GAMIFICATION_CONFIG_UPDATE", oldValues, newValues)
    CfgSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction
    AdmCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK GamificationConfigDto

    Admin->>AdmCtrl: POST /api/v1/admin/gamification/leaderboard-cycles (StartsAt, EndsAt, Top1/2/3 Bonus, IsActive)
    AdmCtrl->>LbSvc: CreateCycleAsync(adminId, request)
    LbSvc->>DB: If IsActive == true -> DeactivateOtherActiveCycles & INSERT leaderboard_cycles
    LbSvc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("LEADERBOARD_CYCLE_CREATE")
    AdmCtrl-->>Admin: 201 Created LeaderboardCycleDto

    Guest->>PubCtrl: GET /api/v1/gamification/leaderboard?top=10&period=Monthly
    PubCtrl->>LbSvc: GetLeaderboardViewAsync(top, period, cycleId, viewerUserId)
    LbSvc->>DB: Load Active Users (Role=User) + UserPointWallet + PointTransactions (Points > 0, != LeaderboardBonus)
    PubCtrl-->>Guest: 200 OK LeaderboardViewDto (Items, MyEntry, ActiveCycle)

    Admin->>AdmCtrl: POST /api/v1/admin/gamification/leaderboard-cycles/{cycleId}/finalize
    AdmCtrl->>LbSvc: FinalizeCycleAsync(adminId, cycleId)
    LbSvc->>DB: Check Status != Finalized/Cancelled & ComputeRankedEntriesAsync(cycle)
    LbSvc->>DB: BeginTransaction
    loop Top 1 -> Top 3 co TotalPoints > 0
        LbSvc->>PtsSvc: CreditAsync(userId, bonus, LeaderboardBonus, LEADERBOARD:cycleId:RANK:i:userId)
    end
    LbSvc->>DB: UPDATE leaderboard_cycles SET Status = Finalized, IsActive = false, WinnersSnapshotJson
    LbSvc->>AuditSvc: LogAsync("LEADERBOARD_CYCLE_FINALIZE")
    LbSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction
    AdmCtrl-->>Admin: 200 OK LeaderboardCycleDto (Winners snapshot + bonuses)
